<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">

<title>About ErsSoft Limited | ERP & Manufacturing Systems Experts</title>

<meta name="description" content="Learn about ErsSoft Limited, a UK-based ERP, JD Edwards and manufacturing systems consulting company delivering enterprise software and data-driven business solutions.">

<link rel="canonical" href="https://erssoft.pages.dev/about">

<meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<!-- Favicon -->
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/assets/favicon-32x32.png">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/assets/favicon-16x16.png">
