<body>

<Header />
<div class="page-content">

<section class="section">
  <h1>About ErsSoft Limited</h1>
  <p>
    ErsSoft Limited is a UK-based ERP and IT consulting company specializing in manufacturing systems,
    enterprise software and data-driven business solutions. We help organizations transform complex
    operations into efficient, transparent and scalable digital environments.
  </p>

  <h2>Who We Are</h2>
  <p>
    The ErsSoft team brings more than 20 years of hands-on experience delivering ERP, manufacturing
    and business intelligence solutions for industrial, engineering, logistics and enterprise organizations.
    We combine deep technical expertise with real-world operational knowledge to create systems that truly
    support business processes.
  </p>
  <p>
    From JD Edwards and Oracle ERP platforms to Power BI reporting and custom-built software,
    ErsSoft Limited delivers practical, reliable and future-proof solutions tailored to each client’s needs.
  </p>

  <h2>Our Leadership & Team</h2>
  <p>
    ErsSoft Limited is led by an experienced ERP and manufacturing systems consulting team with a strong
    background in enterprise IT, production systems and business intelligence. Our leadership focuses on
    delivering measurable business value, operational efficiency and long-term technology strategies
    for our clients.
  </p>

  <h2>Our Approach</h2>
  <p>
    We believe that technology should serve the business — not the other way around. That is why we work
    closely with our clients to understand their processes, challenges and goals before designing and
    implementing solutions.
  </p>

  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Business-Driven Design</h3>
      <p>
        Every system we build is aligned with real operational workflows,
        not just technical specifications.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>Enterprise Reliability</h3>
      <p>
        Our solutions are designed for stability, scalability and long-term maintainability.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>Long-Term Partnership</h3>
      <p>
        We work as a trusted technology partner, supporting our clients as
        their businesses grow and evolve.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</div>
<Footer />

</body>
</html>
